From: Harvi654 <202698022+Harvi654@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: shell32: Yield to edit input between autocomplete enumeration slices

AI-assisted (Codex), original code; LGPL-2.1-or-later. Not submitted upstream.

Windows 10 returned from WM_CHAR before enumerating, and its window
answered probe messages during a slow source callback. Wine 11.22 calls
Next in a loop on the edit thread before returning from WM_CHAR.

Schedule enumeration as short timer callbacks on the edit thread. Keep the
calls in the caller's COM apartment and finish each enumeration before
publishing the suggestions. Cancel pending enumeration when the edit no
longer needs its results. This candidate restores responsiveness between
calls and leaves the remaining difference in callback threading visible.

